sequenceDiagram
    participant API as API (PlaceOrder)
    participant Order as Order Aggregate
    participant ORP as OrderReservationProcess<br/>(Ordering)
    participant SK as StockKeeper<br/>(Inventoring)
    participant Inv as Inventory Aggregate

    API->>Order: Place(customerId, lines)
    Order-->>ORP: OrderCreated (committed, then published)

    loop each line, until one is rejected
        ORP->>SK: ReserveForOrder(sku, qty, orderId)
        SK->>Inv: ReserveStock(sku, qty, orderId)
        Note over SK,Inv: commit; on ConcurrencyException<br/>reload and retry (max 3)
        alt reserved
            Inv-->>SK: StockReserved
            SK-->>ORP: success
            ORP->>Order: MarkLineReserved(sku)
        else rejected
            Inv-->>SK: StockReservationFailed (recorded)
            SK-->>ORP: failure(reason)
            ORP->>Order: Cancel(reason)
        end
    end

    ORP->>Order: commit
    alt every line reserved
        Note over Order: OrderLineReserved…, OrderConfirmed
    else cancelled (rejection or unexpected failure)
        Order-->>ORP: OrderCancelled (lines)
        ORP->>SK: ReleaseForOrder(sku, orderId) per line
        SK->>Inv: ReleaseStock(sku, orderId)
    end
